      "role": "user",
      "content": "That sounds good, but I'm worried Nebula's legal team is going to dig deeper than just \"robust protection.\" They might ask for specifics on any pending litigation or challenges to our recent filings. If they bring up the current inquiry regarding our core data processing patent, how do we handle that without making them think there's a real risk to the IP?",
