      "content": "Wait, if they see the actual filing documents during due diligence, they'll see it's a formal challenge to the patent's validity, not just a documentation check. If they catch us calling it \"routine\" when it's actually potentially invalidating our core tech, they might walk away from the deal entirely. Are you sure we shouldn't just be upfront about the risk to keep them from feeling misled?",
